   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-06-03.FLAC.bootleggermix** (recommended): soundboard; 13 songs; 114 min [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-03.AT853**: source not stated; 13 songs; 116 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The band wore dresses and makeup for a Tennessee celebration during the Witchcraft performance [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-06-03.FLAC.bootleggermix**: taped by Sam Joseph, Nico Wilson, Gaspard Demulemeester and Joseph Santarpia; source: SBD [1]\n- **kglw2023-06-03.AT853**: taped by Twenty8; transferred by Twenty8; source: Audio Technica AT853 hypercardioids > SP battery box > Sony A10 [2]. Also: Audio Technica AT853 mics fed a SoundPro batbox connected to a Sony A10 recorder [2]",
